        "note": "live-tested: aft.page does not serve the uploaded HTML at all - it injects a wrapper/summary page (a 416-byte index.html was served as 9873 bytes, 9461 without the import-map banner). Excluded from the default plan because its served output can never satisfy the verification contract."
